12:["$","section",null,{"id":"ghost","style":{"--hue":"var(--hue-map)","--hue-wash":"color-mix(in srgb, var(--hue-map) 12%, transparent)"},"aria-labelledby":"ghost-heading","className":"Section_section__oysFB Section_raised__hl4Fj","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Section_measure__g_uvf Section_default__LDdwD","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"Section_header__UaYK5","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"Ghost Mode"}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"ghost-heading","className":"Section_title__ubZoF","children":"Going dark is cryptographically dark."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"Section_lede__D6N5u","children":"Ghost Mode is not a flag on a server we promise to honour. Your phone stops taking fixes, and when you come back it comes back under a different key. Here is one day of that, drawn to scale."}]]}],[["$","figure",null,{"className":"page_figure__LJc9F","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"scrollX page_timelineScroll__2CJev","children":["$","svg",null,{"className":"page_timeline___xPw_","viewBox":"0 62 760 236","role":"img","aria-label":"A timeline of one day of Map visibility, in three phases. In the first phase you are visible and sealed position fixes leave your phone under key A. In the middle phase Ghost Mode is on: the band is empty, because no fix is taken at all, and key A stops being used. In the third phase ghost lifts, a fresh key B is minted and handed to your audience, and fixes resume under key B — so nothing from the new session can be read with the old key.","children":[["$","defs",null,{"children":["$","pattern",null,{"id":"voiid-map-hatch","width":"9","height":"9","patternUnits":"userSpaceOnUse","patternTransform":"rotate(45)","children":["$","line",null,{"className":"page_hatch__n0v7u","x1":"0","y1":"0","x2":"0","y2":"9"}]}]}],["$","rect",null,{"className":"page_bandOn__WHm0T","x":"60","y":"100","width":"240","height":"92","rx":"14"}],["$","rect",null,{"className":"page_bandGhost__LRAUX","x":"308","y":"100","width":"154","height":"92","rx":"14"}],["$","rect",null,{"className":"page_bandOn__WHm0T","x":"470","y":"100","width":"230","height":"92","rx":"14"}],["$","text",null,{"className":"page_phase__xoLVT","x":"60","y":"86","children":"VISIBLE"}],["$","text",null,{"className":"page_phase__xoLVT","x":"308","y":"86","children":"GHOST"}],["$","text",null,{"className":"page_phase__xoLVT","x":"470","y":"86","children":"VISIBLE AGAIN"}],[["$","rect","a88",{"className":"page_fix__csSI1","style":{"--blip-delay":"0.39s"},"x":82,"y":"140","width":"12","height":"12","rx":"3.5"}],["$","rect","a128",{"className":"page_fix__csSI1","style":{"--blip-delay":"0.96s"},"x":122,"y":"140","width":"12","height":"12","rx":"3.5"}],["$","rect","a168",{"className":"page_fix__csSI1","style":{"--blip-delay":"1.52s"},"x":162,"y":"140","width":"12","height":"12","rx":"3.5"}],["$","rect","a208",{"className":"page_fix__csSI1","style":{"--blip-delay":"2.08s"},"x":202,"y":"140","width":"12","height":"12","rx":"3.5"}],["$","rect","a248",{"className":"page_fix__csSI1","style":{"--blip-delay":"2.64s"},"x":242,"y":"140","width":"12","height":"12","rx":"3.5"}],["$","rect","a284",{"className":"page_fix__csSI1","style":{"--blip-delay":"3.15s"},"x":278,"y":"140","width":"12","height":"12","rx":"3.5"}]],[["$","rect","c496",{"className":"page_fix__csSI1","style":{"--blip-delay":"6.13s"},"x":490,"y":"140","width":"12","height":"12","rx":"3.5"}],["$","rect","c532",{"className":"page_fix__csSI1","style":{"--blip-delay":"6.64s"},"x":526,"y":"140","width":"12","height":"12","rx":"3.5"}],["$","rect","c568",{"className":"page_fix__csSI1","style":{"--blip-delay":"7.14s"},"x":562,"y":"140","width":"12","height":"12","rx":"3.5"}],["$","rect","c604",{"className":"page_fix__csSI1","style":{"--blip-delay":"7.65s"},"x":598,"y":"140","width":"12","height":"12","rx":"3.5"}],["$","rect","c640",{"className":"page_fix__csSI1","style":{"--blip-delay":"8.16s"},"x":634,"y":"140","width":"12","height":"12","rx":"3.5"}],["$","rect","c676",{"className":"page_fix__csSI1","style":{"--blip-delay":"8.66s"},"x":670,"y":"140","width":"12","height":"12","rx":"3.5"}]],["$","text",null,{"className":"page_bandNoteOn__fTy_B","x":"180","y":"176","children":"sealed fix every few minutes"}],["$","text",null,{"className":"page_bandNoteGhost__4xgO_","x":"385","y":"141","children":"no fix is taken"}],["$","text",null,{"className":"page_bandNoteGhostSub___bPqD","x":"385","y":"162","children":"the GPS is never asked"}],["$","text",null,{"className":"page_bandNoteOn__fTy_B","x":"585","y":"176","children":"sealed fix every few minutes"}],["$","rect",null,{"className":"page_keyBar__s1QWk","x":"60","y":"224","width":"240","height":"12","rx":"6"}],"$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24","$L25","$L26","$L27","$L28"]}]}],"$L29"]}],"$L2a"]]}]}]
13:["$","section",null,{"id":"one-ciphertext","style":{"--hue":"var(--hue-map)","--hue-wash":"color-mix(in srgb, var(--hue-map) 12%, transparent)"},"aria-labelledby":"one-ciphertext-heading","className":"Section_section__oysFB","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Section_measure__g_uvf Section_default__LDdwD","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"Section_header__UaYK5","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"How a position travels"}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"one-ciphertext-heading","className":"Section_title__ubZoF","children":"Encrypted once. Copied, never read."}],null]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"Section_split__EARUL Section_splitStart__gevEq","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"Section_splitCopy__s14lK","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"page_copy__WQPli","children":"A fix is small: a share id, a counter, a timestamp, a latitude, a longitude and how accurate your phone thinks it is. Your device encrypts that once, under the key only your audience holds, and hands the single sealed blob to a relay that copies bytes to each of them."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"page_copy__WQPli","children":"It is never written to our database. It never becomes a push notification — deliberately, because a push would tell Apple and Google that you had started sharing. If nobody’s connection is open, the relay keeps only the newest blob for five minutes and then drops it. Stale positions are worse than none, so there is no queue to replay."}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"page_tally__Dr8H6","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"1"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"encryption per fix, whatever the size of your audience"}]]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"database rows written per fix"}]]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"push notifications sent per fix"}]]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"1"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"position stored per contact, overwritten in place"}]]}]]}],["$","aside",null,{"className":"Callout_callout__ISWo7 Callout_honest__3IihE","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"Callout_icon__0Ievd","aria-hidden":"true","children":["$","svg",null,{"className":"$undefined","style":"$undefined","width":19,"height":19,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":1.6,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","role":"$undefined","aria-label":"$undefined","aria-hidden":true,"focusable":"false","children":"$b:props:children:0:0:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:children:3:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:children"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"Callout_body__YPmy0","children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"Callout_title__tETUp","children":"One key per session, and no forward secrecy inside it."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"Callout_text__zwKcR","children":["$","p",null,{"children":"Everyone in your audience holds the same key for as long as that visibility session lasts, so whoever holds it can read every fix in that session. Starting a new session — going visible again after a ghost, or removing one person — always means a new key. We cannot do better yet: the encryption core has no key-derivation step to build a chain from, and claiming the property anyway would be the actual lie. Because no fix is ever stored, the window is the live stream itself."}]}]]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"Section_splitAside__wXG3e","children":["$","figure",null,{"className":"page_figure__LJc9F","children":[["$","svg",null,{"className":"page_fanout__gYocn","viewBox":"0 0 420 300","role":"img","aria-label":"Your phone encrypts one position fix a single time and hands the sealed packet to the relay. The relay holds no key — it copies the same bytes to each of the four people on your list, whose phones hold the key and can open it.","children":[["$","rect",null,{"className":"page_node___uXWo","x":"18","y":"118","width":"60","height":"64","rx":"12"}],["$","rect",null,{"className":"page_nodeScreen__hBR7o","x":"27","y":"127","width":"42","height":"46","rx":"7"}],["$","text",null,{"className":"page_fanLabel__WdhtQ","x":"48","y":"200","children":"you"}],"$L2b","$L2c","$L2d","$L2e","$L2f","$L30",["$L31","$L32","$L33","$L34"],"$L35"]}],"$L36"]}]}]]}]]}]}]
14:["$","section",null,{"id":"server-row","style":{"--hue":"var(--hue-map)","--hue-wash":"color-mix(in srgb, var(--hue-map) 12%, transparent)"},"aria-labelledby":"server-row-heading","className":"Section_section__oysFB Section_inset__8799Y","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Section_measure__g_uvf Section_default__LDdwD","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"Section_header__UaYK5","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"What we store"}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"server-row-heading","className":"Section_title__ubZoF","children":"This is the entire row."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"Section_lede__D6N5u","children":"Not a summary of it. The two tables below are everything our database holds about a location share, and the second list is the part that matters."}]]}],[["$","div",null,{"className":"page_rowCard__kaRd5","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"page_rowCol__yoPmS","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"page_rowHead__nPfja","children":[["$","svg",null,{"className":"$undefined","style":"$undefined","width":17,"height":17,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":1.6,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","role":"$undefined","aria-label":"$undefined","aria-hidden":true,"focusable":"false","children":[["$","path",null,{"d":"M6 3.8h8.2L19 8.6v11.6H6V3.8Z"}],["$","path",null,{"d":"M14 3.8v5h5M9 13h6M9 16.4h4"}]]}],"What a share row records"]}],["$","dl",null,{"className":"page_cols__LU_S_","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"page_col__8ZbBP","children":[["$","dt",null,{"children":"a share id"}],["$","dd",null,{"children":"an opaque identifier, meaningless on its own"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page_col__8ZbBP","children":[["$","dt",null,{"children":"whose share it is"}],["$","dd",null,{"children":"the account that started it"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page_col__8ZbBP","children":[["$","dt",null,{"children":"which kind"}],["$","dd",null,{"children":"Map presence, or a live share inside one conversation"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page_col__8ZbBP","children":[["$","dt",null,{"children":"started, expires, ended"}],["$","dd",null,{"children":"three timestamps; every share has an expiry, none is indefinite"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page_col__8ZbBP","children":[["$","dt",null,{"children":"who it is for"}],["$","dd",null,{"children":"one line per person, and when each was revoked"}]]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page_rowCol__yoPmS","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"page_rowHead__nPfja page_rowHeadAbsent__KXwJo","children":[["$","svg",null,{"className":"$undefined","style":"$undefined","width":17,"height":17,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":1.6,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","role":"$undefined","aria-label":"$undefined","aria-hidden":true,"focusable":"false","children":"$b:props:children:0:0:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:children:3:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:children"}],"Columns that do not exist"]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"page_absent__PvcIi","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":"latitude"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"longitude"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"accuracy"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"altitude, speed, heading"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"any ciphertext"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"any key"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"last-seen time"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"update count"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"any position, ever recorded"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"page_absentNote__tQyfY","children":"There is deliberately no HTTP endpoint that accepts a coordinate either, and a guard on every location route rejects a request body containing one — because a route that exists is a route somebody eventually posts a latitude to."}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"page_pullQuote__YLeaP","children":"Voiid’s servers know that a share exists, who it is with, and when it ends. They never know where you are, whether you moved, or how often you updated."}]]]}]}]
15:["$","section",null,{"id":"states","style":{"--hue":"var(--hue-map)","--hue-wash":"color-mix(in srgb, var(--hue-map) 12%, transparent)"},"aria-labelledby":"states-heading","className":"Section_section__oysFB","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Section_measure__g_uvf Section_default__LDdwD","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"Section_header__UaYK5","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"Reading the map"}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"states-heading","className":"Section_title__ubZoF","children":"“Lost signal” and “stopped sharing” are different words, different shapes."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"Section_lede__D6N5u","children":"Conflating them is how a map hurts someone. A person whose phone died must never look like a person who chose to disappear, and the reverse matters even more."}]]}],[["$","div",null,{"className":"page_states__8MfIW","children":[["$","div","live",{"className":"page_state__NvWAb","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"page_marker__HASc2 page_marker-live__sqDKo","aria-hidden":"true"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"page_stateName__o1ch_","children":"Live"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"page_stateWhen__2ifVd","children":"Last fix under 15 minutes old"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"page_stateBody__6uYVY","children":"Full-colour avatar, on the map, where they are."}]]}],["$","div","stale",{"className":"page_state__NvWAb","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"page_marker__HASc2 page_marker-stale__fNDWv","aria-hidden":"true"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"page_stateName__o1ch_","children":"Stale"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"page_stateWhen__2ifVd","children":"15 minutes to 8 hours"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"page_stateBody__6uYVY","children":"Desaturated, with a clock and “last seen 2 h ago”. The last known position is kept — a phone in a tunnel is not a phone that stopped sharing."}]]}],["$","div","aged",{"className":"page_state__NvWAb","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"page_marker__HASc2 page_marker-aged__cmahl","aria-hidden":"true"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"page_stateName__o1ch_","children":"Aged out"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"page_stateWhen__2ifVd","children":"Over 8 hours, no stop received"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"page_stateBody__6uYVY","children":"The avatar leaves the map and moves to a list. The position is still theirs to explain; we just stop drawing it as current."}]]}],["$","div","off",{"className":"page_state__NvWAb","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"page_marker__HASc2 page_marker-off__71XNQ","aria-hidden":"true"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"page_stateName__o1ch_","children":"Not sharing"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"page_stateWhen__2ifVd","children":"They turned it off, or the share expired"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"page_stateBody__6uYVY","children":"The cached position is erased. They appear in a “Not sharing” list with no location at all — not a faded one, not an old one."}]]}]]}],["$","aside",null,{"className":"Callout_callout__ISWo7 Callout_note__d2YN0","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"Callout_icon__0Ievd","aria-hidden":"true","children":["$","svg",null,{"className":"$undefined","style":"$undefined","width":19,"height":19,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":1.6,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","role":"$undefined","aria-label":"$undefined","aria-hidden":true,"focusable":"false","children":"$11:props:children:props:children:1:props:children:2:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:props:children"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"Callout_body__YPmy0","children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"Callout_title__tETUp","children":"The load-bearing difference."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"Callout_text__zwKcR","children":["$","p",null,{"children":["An explicit stop ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"erases"}]," the position your phone had cached for that person. An age-out ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"keeps"}]," it. That asymmetry is the whole reason you can tell “they turned it off” from “their battery went” — and it is why Voiid draws no trails, keeps no history, and wipes anything older than eight hours on a cold start."]}]}]]}]]}]]]}]}]
16:["$","section",null,{"id":"live-share","style":{"--hue":"var(--hue-map)","--hue-wash":"color-mix(in srgb, var(--hue-map) 12%, transparent)"},"aria-labelledby":"live-share-heading","className":"Section_section__oysFB Section_raised__hl4Fj","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Section_measure__g_uvf Section_default__LDdwD","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"Section_header__UaYK5","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"In a chat"}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"live-share-heading","className":"Section_title__ubZoF","children":"Live location is a tighter, shorter thing on purpose."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"Section_lede__D6N5u","children":"The Map is an ambient standing state. Sharing live inside a conversation is an explicit act with an end time, so it is built to different rules — more precise, more visible while it runs, and never open-ended."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"Section_split__EARUL Section_splitReverse__nHp72 Section_splitStart__gevEq","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"Section_splitCopy__s14lK","children":["$","dl",null,{"className":"page_spec__0AzZY","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"children":"15 minutes, 1 hour, or 8 hours"}],["$","dd",null,{"children":"There is no indefinite option, in a chat or on the Map. The sheet names the audience above the picker — “everyone in Design Team (7 people) will see your live location” — so nobody shares into a room they had not counted."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"children":"The timer is the guarantee, not the courtesy"}],["$","dd",null,{"children":"Both phones hold the end time locally, and the recipient hides the marker at that moment with no network contact at all. It works if you are offline, out of battery, uninstalled, or actively hostile. Everything else — the instant stop, the durable stop message that reaches someone who was offline — is an optimisation on top of that."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"children":"Removing one person re-keys the rest"}],["$","dd",null,{"children":"Revoke a single recipient and they get a stop, then everyone still watching gets a fresh key. From that moment the person you removed decrypts nothing further, rather than being politely asked not to look."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"children":"Impossible to forget it is running"}],["$","dd",null,{"children":"A banner sits under the header of your chat list and the conversation, with the time remaining and a Stop button. iOS shows its own background-location indicator; Android shows an ongoing notification with a Stop action. A local reminder fires two minutes before it ends."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"children":"Groups work the same way"}],["$","dd",null,{"children":"A pin or a live share in a group rides the same encrypted group messaging as everything else in it. A pin is just a message: it sits in the history like any other, and carries the label you typed — we never resolve a coordinate into an address, because that would hand a friend’s position to a geocoder."}]]}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"Section_splitAside__wXG3e","children":["$","div",null,{"style":{"--hue":"var(--hue-map)","--hue-wash":"color-mix(in srgb, var(--hue-map) 12%, transparent)"},"className":"PhoneMockup_stage__MqCWh PhoneMockup_md__AEOC_ PhoneMockup_tilt-right__TTetu","role":"img","aria-label":"A group chat in Voiid. A live location card shows a map thumbnail, the line “Live until 15:42” and a Stop control, above a note saying the share ends on its own.","aria-hidden":"$undefined","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"PhoneMockup_glow__zF2vu","aria-hidden":"true"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"PhoneMockup_device__za_KM","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"PhoneMockup_buttonVolumeUp__pCT_2","aria-hidden":"true"}],"$L37","$L38","$L39"]}]]}]}]]}]]}]}]
17:["$","section",null,{"id":"limits","style":{"--hue":"var(--hue-map)","--hue-wash":"color-mix(in srgb, var(--hue-map) 12%, transparent)"},"aria-labelledby":"limits-heading","className":"Section_section__oysFB","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Section_measure__g_uvf Section_narrow__HwGay","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"Section_header__UaYK5","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"The honest part"}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"limits-heading","className":"Section_title__ubZoF","children":"What this design does not give you."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"Section_lede__D6N5u","children":"Collected in one place so that nobody — including us — ships a screen that promises them."}]]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"page_limits__mHMD_","children":[["$","li","Map tiles leak the viewport to Apple or Google.",{"className":"page_limit__C_zD7","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"page_limitGlyph__229bD","aria-hidden":"true","children":["$","svg",null,{"className":"$undefined","style":"$undefined","width":18,"height":18,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":1.6,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","role":"$undefined","aria-label":"$undefined","aria-hidden":true,"focusable":"false","children":"$0:f:0:1:1:props:children:1:props:children:props:children:3:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:children:2:props:children:0:props:children"}]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"page_limitTitle__Iiao5","children":"Map tiles leak the viewport to Apple or Google."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"page_limitBody__NMgDw","children":"Drawing a map means asking someone for tiles: Apple Maps on iOS, Google Maps on Android. Voiid’s server stays blind; the tile provider does not. What we do control, we did — every thumbnail is rendered on your own device, so a sender’s position is never uploaded as a picture on a viewer’s behalf, and a friend’s coordinate is never sent to a geocoder to be turned into a street address."}]]}]]}],["$","li","The relay cannot check who is allowed to receive a fix.",{"className":"page_limit__C_zD7","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"page_limitGlyph__229bD","aria-hidden":"true","children":["$","svg",null,{"className":"$undefined","style":"$undefined","width":18,"height":18,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":1.6,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","role":"$undefined","aria-label":"$undefined","aria-hidden":true,"focusable":"false","children":[["$","rect",null,{"x":"7.2","y":"2.8","width":"9.6","height":"18.4","rx":"2.6"}],["$","path",null,{"d":"M10.6 5.3h2.8"}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"page_limitTitle__Iiao5","children":"The relay cannot check who is allowed to receive a fix."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"page_limitBody__NMgDw","children":"The WebSocket process has no database, so it cannot verify that a recipient is on your list — it only knows who sent the frame. Your friends’ phones do that check instead, dropping any fix from a share they hold no key for. Someone relaying frames at strangers gains nothing: without the key it decrypts to noise."}]]}]]}],["$","li","Revoking stops the next fix. It cannot un-see the last one.",{"className":"page_limit__C_zD7","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"page_limitGlyph__229bD","aria-hidden":"true","children":["$","svg",null,{"className":"$undefined","style":"$undefined","width":18,"height":18,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":1.6,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","role":"$undefined","aria-label":"$undefined","aria-hidden":true,"focusable":"false","children":[["$","circle",null,{"cx":"8","cy":"12","r":"3.4"}],["$","path",null,{"d":"M11.4 12H20M17.4 12v3M14.6 12v2.2"}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"page_limitTitle__Iiao5","children":"Revoking stops the next fix. It cannot un-see the last one."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"page_limitBody__NMgDw","children":"Anyone who could see your position could have written it down or screenshotted it. Revocation and Ghost Mode are about what happens next, and no wording on this page or in the app pretends otherwise."}]]}]]}],["$","li","We know a share exists, who it is with, and when it ends.",{"className":"page_limit__C_zD7","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"page_limitGlyph__229bD","aria-hidden":"true","children":"$L3a"}],"$L3b"]}],"$L3c"]}]]}]}]
